        "original_id": "f26e706f-2528-5dd4-b8a3-dc94acfff0b2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Lambic, wheat beer, Weissbier, Witbier, Berliner Weisse, Gose\n- Companies: Cantillon Brewery\n- Places: Pajottenland, Belgium, Brussels, Anderlecht\n\nFacts:\n- Cantillon Brewery was founded in 1900.\n- Cantillon Brewery is a small traditional Belgian family brewery based in Anderlecht, Brussels.\n- Lambic is a type of beer brewed in the Pajottenland region of Belgium southwest of Brussels.\n- Lambic is also brewed in Brussels at Cantillon Brewery.\n- Wheat beer has two main varieties: Weissbier and Witbier.\n- Wheat beer includes Lambic, Berliner Weisse, and Gose as minor types.",
